compiler/rt/str.ts: HalfSipHash-1-3 is implemented from the SipHash paper's description (Aumasson and Bernstein, 2012);
the reference code is CC0 and wasn't copied. compiler/rt/map.ts: the integer finaliser is MurmurHash3's fmix32 (Austin
Appleby, public domain), with a key mixed in. compiler/rt/num.ts: printing is from Burger and Dybvig's PLDI 1996 paper,
reading from Clinger's PLDI 1990 paper. compiler/rt/case-tables.ts is generated from V8's behaviour here, and so from
Unicode's data, under the Unicode licence, by tools/gen-case-tables.ts.

packages/tsl-std/ex-std-str.ts: HalfSipHash-1-3, as for compiler/rt/str.ts, from the paper's description. packages/tsl-std/ex-std-global.ts:
the same keyed fmix32 as compiler/rt/map.ts. Neither is copied from a reference tree.
